msgid "   (a) SKQD comes with convergence guarantees that SQD does not. In SQD you either need to make a very good guess for your ansatz that has excellent overlap with the ground state support in the computational basis, or you need to introduce a variational component to the calculation to sample a family of ansaetze.\n"
